            <ArticleTitle>[Rehabilitation as an integral part of the long-term management of bronchial asthma--what's new from the point of view of rehabilitation medicine].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>441-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Pulmonary rehabilitation is an integral and original part of the German National Disease Management Guideline for Asthma with clearly defined tasks within a comprehensive long-term management of asthma. The following short overview describes methods, indications for and effectiveness of pulmonary rehabilitation for adult patients with asthma.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
